  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/02/IMG_2257.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El pub D&eacute;cada, en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 110 de Onda, ha acogido la noche de este&nbsp;viernes un&nbsp;vibrante concierto de The Autan Plus Band, grupo punk-rock, que ha imprimido a versiones de varios temas su inconfundible garra. En una de las canciones ha colaborado a la voz a Iris.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2176.jpg\" alt=\"img_2176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2178.jpg\" alt=\"img_2178\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2179.jpg\" alt=\"img_2179\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2180.jpg\" alt=\"img_2180\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2182.jpg\" alt=\"img_2182\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2183.jpg\" alt=\"img_2183\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2184.jpg\" alt=\"img_2184\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2186.jpg\" alt=\"img_2186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concerttheautanplusbanddecada/img_2188.jpg\" alt=\"i